sequenceDiagram
    participant SR as SearchRepository
    participant SAC as safeApiCall
    participant RF as Retrofit Api
    participant IC as Interceptors
    participant OK as OkHttpClient
    participant BK as Backend
    SR->>SAC: safeApiCall - api.search(q)
    SAC->>RF: suspend search(q)
    RF->>IC: Request
    IC->>IC: add correlation id, headers, auth
    IC->>OK: proceed(request)
    OK->>BK: HTTP GET (HTTP/2, gzip)
    BK-->>OK: 200 + JSON
    OK-->>RF: Response
    RF-->>SAC: List of ProductDto
    SAC-->>SR: Outcome.Success(dtos)
